{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670906109528279342","title":"IC验证工程师","description":"1、负责手机或车规芯片核心功能（ISP，AI/NPU，显示处理，音频，视频等）的全流程验证，包括UT/BT/IT/ST及网表验证。\n2、制定验证计划及验证策略，构建模块级到系统级的可重用验证架构\n3、基于UVM方法学搭建可扩展验证平台，开发并调试用例\n4、基于覆盖率驱动（CDV）方法学，达成功能/代码/断言覆盖率目标\n5、开发或优化验证脚本，提高整体验证效率\n6、开展业界前沿技术（如AI辅助验证、形式化验证）等的预研与创新落地，推动验证方法学升级，建立行业领先的验证技术体系","requirement":"1、硕士及以上学历\n2、微电子、集成电路、通信、计算机、自动化等专业，其它专业如果有较强的编程能力也可以考虑\n3、至少熟悉一门编程语言 (c/c++/python/perl/java/systemverilog/verilog)\n4、电子或者编程类竞赛获奖者优先考虑\n5、具备较好的英文文档阅读和书写能力\n6、具备较强的自学能力和团队协作精神","city_info":{"code":"CT_22","name":"成都","en_name":"Chengdu","i18n_name":"成都"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786022381213,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178830559051874412","name":"硬件研发类","en_name":"Hardware R\u0026D","i18n_name":"硬件研发类"},"job_id":"7670906109528115502","city_list":[{"code":"CT_22","name":"成都","en_name":"Chengdu","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"成都","py_name":"chengdu","mdm_code":"MDCY00000342","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_155","name":"西安","en_name":"Xi'an","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"西安","py_name":"xian","mdm_code":"MDCY00000395","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"a